WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.195
Lesson 4.8.

00:00:02.195 --> 00:00:06.430
Tokenized treasuries and real-world assets (RWAs).

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.584
By the end of this lesson, you'll be

00:00:08.584 --> 00:00:11.669
able to use tokenized real-world assets knowing what

00:00:11.669 --> 00:00:14.055
you actually own and who you're trusting.

00:00:15.355 --> 00:00:16.645
Here's the plan.

00:00:16.645 --> 00:00:18.330
First, the key ideas.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.045
Then, a worked example, step by step.

00:00:21.045 --> 00:00:22.570
Then, your checklist.

00:00:22.570 --> 00:00:24.732
And finally, a three-question quiz.

00:00:26.032 --> 00:00:29.428
First, RWAs are tokens that represent off-chain

00:00:29.428 --> 00:00:33.319
assets: short-term government bills (the most common),

00:00:33.319 --> 00:00:37.157
money-market funds, credit, commodities, property.

00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:40.541
Next, Tokenized treasury products typically pay close to

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:44.047
the short-term government rate minus a management fee.

00:00:44.047 --> 00:00:47.603
Then, what you're trusting: the issuer (legal structure),

00:00:47.603 --> 00:00:50.913
the custodian holding the real assets, the redemption

00:00:50.913 --> 00:00:53.665
process, and the token's transfer rules.

00:00:53.665 --> 00:00:57.356
Also, Access limits: many RWA tokens are

00:00:57.356 --> 00:01:02.849
only for verified (KYC'd) or accredited/qualified investors,

00:01:02.849 --> 00:01:06.300
and not available in every country.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:08.523
Check eligibility where you live; don't

00:01:08.523 --> 00:01:10.546
try to get around restrictions.

00:01:10.546 --> 00:01:14.229
And finally, Composability: some RWA tokens can

00:01:14.229 --> 00:01:17.145
be used as collateral in DeFi; others

00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:20.061
are restricted to allowlisted wallets.

00:01:21.361 --> 00:01:23.876
Let's work an example, step by step.

00:01:23.876 --> 00:01:28.257
If short-term government bills yield 4.0% and

00:01:28.257 --> 00:01:32.448
the product charges 0.15%, you'd earn about

00:01:32.448 --> 00:01:35.796
3.85% before any on-chain costs.

00:01:35.796 --> 00:01:39.283
In the own-bank ladder (Module 12.4), this can

00:01:39.283 --> 00:01:42.622
suit the T1/T2 tiers, but only if redemption

00:01:42.622 --> 00:01:45.516
times match when you'll need the money.

00:01:46.816 --> 00:01:48.276
Here's your checklist.

00:01:48.276 --> 00:01:49.811
Do it now, for real.

00:01:49.811 --> 00:01:51.894
First, I'm eligible in my country

00:01:51.894 --> 00:01:53.726
(and it's legal to hold).

00:01:53.726 --> 00:01:57.466
Next, Issuer, custodian and redemption terms read.

00:01:57.466 --> 00:02:00.521
Then, Transfer restrictions and minimums known.

00:02:00.521 --> 00:02:02.560
And finally, Sized within caps,

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:04.281
like any other issuer risk.

00:02:05.581 --> 00:02:06.791
Question 1.

00:02:06.791 --> 00:02:09.486
What does a tokenized treasury product's yield track?

00:02:13.906 --> 00:02:17.851
The answer: Short-term government rates, minus the product's fees.

00:02:19.151 --> 00:02:20.396
Question 2.

00:02:20.396 --> 00:02:23.771
Name two parties you trust with an RWA token.

00:02:28.071 --> 00:02:30.386
The answer: Any two: the issuer, the

00:02:30.386 --> 00:02:34.141
custodian, the redemption agent, the token's administrators.

00:02:35.441 --> 00:02:36.711
Question 3.

00:02:36.711 --> 00:02:38.466
Why check transfer restrictions?

00:02:42.886 --> 00:02:46.446
The answer: Some RWA tokens only move between

00:02:46.446 --> 00:02:50.471
allowlisted wallets, which limits exit and DeFi use.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:53.016
Let's recap.

00:02:53.016 --> 00:02:57.216
RWAs are tokens that represent off-chain assets.

00:02:57.216 --> 00:03:00.458
Tokenized treasury products typically pay close to the

00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:03.706
short-term government rate minus a management fee.

00:03:03.706 --> 00:03:06.840
What you're trusting: the issuer (legal structure),

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.431
the custodian holding the real assets.

00:03:09.431 --> 00:03:13.254
Access limits: many RWA tokens are only

00:03:13.254 --> 00:03:18.511
for verified (KYC'd) or accredited/qualified investors.

00:03:19.811 --> 00:03:22.326
Do the checklist now, before you move on.

00:03:22.326 --> 00:03:25.541
Next up, Lesson 5.0: Mastery Starter.
